	A wakizashi is the companion to the katana, as to wear both was consid-
ered a mark of nobility/regality.  As most weapons were restricted to those of
the samurai and above, the peasants of Japan developed such non-lethal 'looking'
weapons as nunchakus and shurikens.  The wakizashi is a slightly shorter version
of a katana, and shurikens are the throwing stars of the ninja, which is odd, as
any self-respecting, honorable samurai would rather die than use a weapon as
sinister as the shuriken. :)  
